    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sethe, a former slave haunted by the traumatic legacy of her past and the ghost of her dead daughter, struggles to reclaim her identity and find healing when the mysterious young woman Belovedwho may embody her lost childs spiritarrives at her Cincinnati home, forcing Sethe and her community to confront the painful wounds of slavery, memory, and love.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
