    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An orphaned boy named Hugo, living in a Paris train station, unravels a mystery involving an automaton, a hidden message, and the origins of early filmmaking</TTEXTS:has_summary>
    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Hugo, an orphan living in a Paris train station, discovers a broken automaton and embarks on a quest to unlock its secrets, which leads him to a surprising connection with a forgotten filmmaker.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
