    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Meg travels through time and space with her brother and friend to rescue her father, which leads her to question the power of darkness and discover the strength of love and individuality.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
