    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A young German soldier who, along with his classmates, enlists in World War I, only to face the brutal realities of trench warfare, the loss of comrades, and the profound disillusionment with the ideals that led them to war.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
