    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Melba Pattillo Beals recounts her courageous experience as one of the Little Rock Nine, bravely integrating Central High School amid violent opposition during the Civil Rights Movement.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
