    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Santiago Nasar is murdered by the Vicario brothers to avenge the dishonor of their sister and despite the widespread knowledge of their plan, Santiago is killed in broad daylight, and no one intervenes to stop the murder, even though it was foretold to many in the town.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
