    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After overthrowing their human owner, the animals on the farm create a society that is also corrupted and tyrannical due to an unequal balance of power. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
