    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Crime and Punishment is a psychological novel thatexplores the moral and psychological consequences of crime as its protagonist, Rodion Raskolnikov, an impoverished student, justifies his murder of an old pawnbroker.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
