    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In Mexican Gothic, glamorous socialite Noem Taboada travels to a decaying English estate in rural Mexico to check on her ailing cousin, only to uncover a horrifying legacy of colonial violence, eugenics, and supernatural control rooted in a sentient, life-extending fungus and a family determined to preserve their power at any cost.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
