    <TTEXTS:has_text_type rdf:resource="https://koncordantlab.com/TTEXTS/Graphic_Novel"/>
    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Omar and his brother Hassan grow up in Dadaab, a refugee camp in Kenya, while waiting for the Civil War in Somalia to end. Omar struggles with the choice between pursuing an education or caring for his nonverbal brother, exploring equality, disability, and the power of education. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
