    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">William Kamkwamba teaches himself how to build a windmill to save his village from famine, revealing how perseverance and creativity can change lives even in the face of extreme poverty.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
