    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Set in 1960s Jackson, Mississippi, The Help follows the secret collaboration between Skeeter, an aspiring white writer, and two Black maids, Aibileen and Minny, as they courageously share the harsh realities of working for white families, challenging racism and societal norms in the Jim Crow South.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
