    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Young Tiger and their family flee a war-torn country on foot, and as they face hunger, danger, and an uncertain future, Tigers determination to save a small fish becomes a powerful symbol of hope, compassion, and the will to survive.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
