    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"> Ijeoma Oluo equips readers with candid, question-driven guidance on navigating systemic racism, privilege, and uncomfortable conversationsempowering individuals to engage thoughtfully and drive social change.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
