    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Ebenezer Scrooge, a cold-hearted and miserly man, is visited on Christmas Eve by the ghosts of Christmas Past, Present, and Yet to Come. Through these supernatural encounters, he confronts the consequences of his greed and transforms into a kinder, more generous person.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
