    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Refugee follows the intertwined journeys of three childrenJosef fleeing Nazi Germany in 1938, Isabel escaping Cuba in 1994, and Mahmoud leaving war-torn Syria in 2015as they and their families seek safety and a new life, facing immense hardship, loss, and resilience across different times and continents.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
