    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Set during the French Revolution, this novel follows the intertwined lives of Charles Darnay, a French aristocrat, and Sydney Carton, an English lawyer, as they navigate love, sacrifice, and redemption amidst the chaos of revolution and vengeance.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
