    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Jonathan Harker travels to Transylvania to meet Count Dracula, discovers the counts vampire nature and imprisonment, while back in England, Draculas evil spreads through attacks on Harkers fiance Mina and her friend Lucy, leading a group including Van Helsing and Jonathan to unite in hunting and ultimately destroying Dracula.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
