    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After growing withdran after a traumatic event at a summer paper, Melinda must learn how to reclaim her voice by confronting her trauma and expressing herself. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
