    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">As the title suggests, this novel takes place over the course of one day in Ivan's life. Sentenced to a camp in the Soviet Gulag system, the novel explores the injustice the young man faces as he's blamed and accused of being a spy. Although innocent, he is forced to spend 10 years in this camp. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
