    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This harrowing nonfiction account follows the journey of twenty-six Mexican men who attempted to cross the deadly Arizona desert in 2001, exposing the brutal realities of immigration, border policy, and human survival.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
