    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">"The Listeners" depicts a mysterious traveler who arrives at a quiet, abandoned house seeking a response, only to be met by silent, ghostly presences, evoking themes of isolation, unanswered questions, and the supernatural.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
