    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Immortal Life of Henrietta Lacks uncovers the true story of Henrietta Lacks, whose cancer cells were taken without her knowledge and led to groundbreaking medical advances, while exploring the ethical and racial issues surrounding her legacy.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
