    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An epic tale that follows a young sailor falsely imprisoned due to a conspiracy, who escapes after years of torment, discovers a hidden treasure, and transforms himself into the enigmatic Count of Monte Cristo to exact calculated revenge on those who wronged him. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
