    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Killers of the Flower Moon recounts the brutal murders of wealthy Osage Nation members in the 1920s Reign of Terror, the ensuing flawed local investigations, the eventual federal crackdown led by Agent Tom White, and the authors modern-day efforts to uncover the full scope of this dark chapter of American history.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
