    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In Island of the Blue Dolphins, a young girl named Karana is left alone on her island after a series of tragedies, including the deaths of her father and brother, and over many years she survives by relying on her courage, resourcefulness, and the companionship of animals, until she is finally rescued.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
