    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Ned Begay, a Navajo Marine, recounts his journey from a childhood of cultural suppression in boarding school to becoming a celebrated World War II code talker, ultimately sharing his story with his grandchildren to honor his heritage and inspire future generations.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
