    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Through a firsthand account of his life in bondage, Frederick Douglass exposes the cruelty of slavery and demonstrates how education became a tool for liberation and self-realization.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
