    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After being cast down from Olympus, the god Apollo must survive as a powerless teenage mortal named Lester Papadopoulos and complete a dangerous quest to regain his place among the gods.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
