    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Annabel Lee is a hauntingly romantic poem that mourns the loss of a beloved, celebrating their eternal love that even death cannot diminish.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
