    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">See It Through is a motivational call to face challenges with courage and determination. It encourages perseverance in difficult times, emphasizing the importance of inner strength, grit, and never giving up when confronted with fear or hardship.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
