    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The governement prioritizes stability and happiness over individuality and freedom, but two men from different backgrounds grapple with the consequences of a world that sacrifices humanity for the sake of order and pleasure. </TTEXTS:has_summary>
