    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Four Chinese American daughters and their immigrant mothers navigate cultural identity, generational conflict, and personal history as they share their stories through the lens of the Joy Luck Club. Through intertwined narratives, the novel explores the complex bonds between mothers and daughters, shaped by loss, resilience, and the blending of two worlds.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
