    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Born to Run: A Hidden Tribe, Superathletes, and the Greatest Race the World has Never Seen by Christopher McDougall explores the secrets of the Tarahumara Indians, a reclusive tribe in Mexico known for their superhuman long-distance running abilities, while challenging modern running myths and celebrating the joy of running.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
