    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Told through powerful student journal entries, The Freedom Writers Diary follows a first-year teacher and her at-risk high school students as they overcome violence, racism, and hardship through writing, ultimately finding hope, identity, and purpose.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
