    <TTEXTS:has_summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In The Merchant of Venice, the Venetian merchant Antonio risks his life to help his friend Bassanio woo the heiress Portia, leading to a dramatic courtroom showdown with the vengeful moneylender Shylock, but love, cleverness, and mercy ultimately triumph over greed and prejudice.</TTEXTS:has_summary>
    <TTEXTS:has_year_of_publication rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear">1605</TTEXTS:has_year_of_publication>
